  "description": "dYdX v4 perpetual DEX client for .NET — Indexer REST + public WebSocket + signed Indexer reads + full Cosmos SDK transaction signing (BIP-39 mnemonic → BIP-32 derivation at Cosmos default path m/44'/118'/0'/0/0 → secp256k1 with RFC-6979 deterministic-k → bech32 `dydx1…` address → protobuf TxRaw → REST broadcast to the validator). End-to-end verified on testnet. Implements EasyTrading.Abstractions for cross-DEX strategies. Part of the EasyTrading.pw trading ecosystem — powers Copytrader (copytrader.pw), TradeStat (tradestat.pw), and XTester (xtester.pw) in production.",
